Package: vicrental
Title: Tools and Shiny App for Exploring Victorian Rental Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Thunchanok", "Udomittipong", email = "tudo0001@student.monash.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a cleaned dataset of median weekly rents and new
    lettings for Victorian suburbs, functions to summarise rents over time,
    rank suburbs and find suburbs within a budget, and a Shiny app for
    exploring them interactively.
